{
  "title": "Beurre d'Escargot (Garlic-and-Herb \"Escargot\" Butter)",
  "description": "This exceedingly simple garlic-and-herb butter comes together in minutes—and instantly upgrades vegetables, chicken, bread, pasta, and more.",
  "servings": "16",
  "instructions": "In a food processor, pulse garlic, shallot, parsley leaves, salt, and a crack of black pepper until finely ground, about 10 to 15 pulses. (Do not overprocess; it should be finely ground but not a paste.)\n\nAdd butter and blend until well-combined, 1 to 2 minutes. Transfer to jar or airtight container and refrigerate.",
